  "description": "HTTP/REST testing extensions for XUnitAssured. Provides fluent DSL for testing REST APIs with support for HTTP methods, headers, authentication (OAuth2, Bearer, Basic, Certificate), and response validation. v4.0: Added HttpValidationBuilder and BDD extensions (consolidated from XUnitAssured.Extensions). v5.0: Added .NET 10 support.",
